  "notes": "Dealer-distributed XCMG brochure (scanned). Text layer is OCR and dropped some cells; every value was checked against a 200-dpi render and 1.0 t at 44 m/58 m boom and 46 m/55 m boom were entered from the image. Chart includes weight of main hook block, rope and slings (note 3) and full counterweight (note 5). 360° not stated explicitly. Min-radius cells printed as capacity/radius were omitted from the grid (not on a standard radius row): 16 m 68.0 t @4.2 m; 22 m 47.5 t @5.3 m; 28 m 35.2 t @6.5 m; 34 m 28.2 t @7.5 m; 52 m 16.5 t @10.7 m; 55 m 14.2 t @11 m. 16 columns (13-58 m); 12 selected. Weight 61 t = total vehicle mass with 75 t hook & 13 m boom. Counterweight 21.6 t = tray 4 t + 6x2 t + 2x2.8 t. Dims: track length 6.27 = 3090+3180 (derived from side view); track gauge 4100 \"track in working state\"; tail radius 4300 (rear of counterweight to slew centre)."
